===India===
On July 27, 2022, Lollapalooza announced that they would be debuting at the [[Mahalaxmi Racecourse]] in Mumbai, India, on January 28–29, 2023. This would be Lollapalooza's first event in Asia, partnering with BookMyShow.<ref>{{cite web |title= Lollapalooza Heads to Mumbai, India for 2023 Edition |url= https://variety.com/2022/music/news/lollapalooza-india-mumbai-2023-dates-1235326774/ |website=[[Variety (magazine)|Variety]] |date= July 27, 2022 }}</ref> The headliners of the two-day event were [[Imagine Dragons]], [[the Strokes]], and [[Diplo]].<ref name=":4">{{Cite web |date=November 3, 2022 |title=Lollapalooza India has just announced its much-awaited lineup |url=https://www.vogue.in/culture-and-living/content/the-lollapalooza-india-lineup-has-some-outstanding-names |access-date=March 30, 2023 |website=Vogue India}}</ref> The lineup included nearly forty artists,<ref>{{Cite web |date=January 29, 2023 |title=Lollapalooza: Two-day global music festival begins in Mumbai |url=https://indianexpress.com/article/cities/mumbai/lollapalooza-two-day-global-music-festival-begins-in-mumbai-8410165/ |access-date=March 30, 2023 |website=The Indian Express}}{{subscription required}}</ref> such as [[Cigarettes After Sex]], [[Raveena Aurora|Raveena]], [[Greta Van Fleet]], [[Japanese Breakfast]], [[the Wombats]], [[Jackson Wang]], and [[AP Dhillon]].<ref name=":4" /><ref>{{Cite web |last=Tagat |first=Anurag |date=November 3, 2022 |title=Lollapalooza India 2023 Announces Imagine Dragons, The Strokes, Greta Van Fleet, Jackson Wang, Cigarettes After Sex |url=https://rollingstoneindia.com/lollapalooza-india-2023-lineup-imagine-dragons-the-strokes-greta-van-fleet-jackson-wang-cigarettes-after-sex-diplo-japanese-breakfast/ |access-date=March 30, 2023 |website=Rolling Stone India }}</ref><ref>{{Cite web |title=Lollapalooza India 2023 – Lolla Tickets & Event Packages {{!}} Biggest Music Concert |url=https://www.lollaindia.com/ |access-date=March 30, 2023 |website=Lollapalooza}}</ref>

Lollapalooza India's second edition was held the following year, with [[Jonas Brothers]] and [[Sting (musician)|Sting]] being the headliners.<ref>{{Cite web |date=January 25, 2024 |title=Lollapalooza India 2024: Sting, Jonas Brothers, Halsey, The Rose and more take the stage in Mumbai this weekend |url=https://www.thehindu.com/life-and-style/lollapalooza-india-2024-sting-jonas-brothers-halsey-the-rose-and-more-take-the-stage-in-mumbai-this-weekend/article67769830.ece |url-status=live |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240126115058/https://www.thehindu.com/life-and-style/lollapalooza-india-2024-sting-jonas-brothers-halsey-the-rose-and-more-take-the-stage-in-mumbai-this-weekend/article67769830.ece/amp/ |archive-date=January 26, 2024 |access-date=March 22, 2025 |website=The Hindu}}</ref> The 2025 edition saw [[Green Day]] and [[Shawn Mendes]] headline<ref name=":5">{{Cite web |date=September 10, 2024 |title=Lollpalooza India 2025: Green Day, Shawn Mendes, Glass Animals set to perform |url=https://www.thehindu.com/entertainment/music/lollpalooza-india-2025-green-day-shawn-mendes-glass-animals-set-to-perform/article68624940.ece |url-status=live |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20241007172927/https://www.thehindu.com/entertainment/music/lollpalooza-india-2025-green-day-shawn-mendes-glass-animals-set-to-perform/article68624940.ece |archive-date=October 7, 2024 |access-date=March 22, 2025 |website=The Hindu}}</ref> and also featured international artists like [[Louis Tomlinson]], [[Glass Animals]], [[Aurora (singer)|Aurora]], [[Cory Wong]], and [[Zedd]] and Indian musicians such as [[Hanumankind]], [[Niladri Kumar]], and [[Aditi Saigal|DOT]], among others.<ref name=":5" /><ref>{{Cite web |last=Sah |first=Purnima |date=March 10, 2025 |title=Lollapalooza India 2025 wraps up its third edition in style |url=https://www.thehindu.com/entertainment/music/lollapalooza-india-2025-wraps-up-its-third-edition-in-style/article69312573.ece |url-status=live |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20250316065434/https://www.thehindu.com/entertainment/music/lollapalooza-india-2025-wraps-up-its-third-edition-in-style/article69312573.ece/amp/ |archive-date=March 16, 2025 |access-date=March 22, 2025 |website=The Hindu}}</ref>

Lollapalooza India's 2026 edition had [[Playboi Carti]] and [[Linkin Park]] as headliners.<ref>{{cite web |title=Live Review: Lollapalooza India – Mumbai 2026 |url=https://www.reflectionsofdarkness.com/festivals/24236-live-review-lollapalooza-india-mumbai-2026 |website=reflectionsofdarkness.com |access-date=January 29, 2026 |date=February 5, 2026}}</ref>

